      "text": "Weather is an engine system (Unreal Niagara, Unity VFX Graph, Roblox ParticleEmitter). From Blender, export the **masks**: the vertex color attribute (`--vertex-mask`) or baked textures (`blender-texture-baking` self-bake of the wet material), plus snow cover meshes. Details are in [references/realtime-engines.md](references/realtime-engines.md). Physical values and the look library are in [references/weather-values.md](references/weather-values.md)."
